This supplementary material accompanies the paper "Strangers Consoling Each Other": A Systematic Review of Transgender and Gender Diverse Navigation of Social Media" (CHI 2027 submission).

01_search_strategy/ — final search strings per database and links to reproduce each query; full text of the RQs and operational questions guiding data extraction.

02_screening_process/ — decision records for each of the three screening stages (title/abstract, diagonal reading, full-text), including reviewer agreement/disagreement resolution and the list of studies excluded due to unavailable full text (EC7). Reviewer identities are anonymized as R1/R2/R3 consistent with the anonymized paper submission.

03_quality_assessment/ — quality criteria scores (QC1-QC8) for all 45 included studies.

04_included_studies_metadata/ — bibliographic and closed-coding metadata (year, venue, sample, age range, platforms, etc.) for each of the 45 included studies.

05_extended_taxonomies/ — calibrated codes and full taxonomies, including two dimensions (usage expectations; platform policies and design features already in use) that were extracted but not synthesized in the main paper, made available here to support future research.
